    {
      "id": "the_winter_room_03",
      "kind": "line",
      "text": "The Winter Room curves along the top floor beneath a shallow glass roof. At lunchtime it seats a hundred and forty. Tonight a single round table occupies its center, laid for eight beneath low amber lamps. Los Angeles continues beyond the windows as a field of lights without an audience.",
